<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CYBERNEXA | الدعم الفني</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { background-color: #070b16; color: #fff; font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif; margin: 0; }
        .navbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 20px 40px; background: #0f172a; border-bottom: 1px solid #334155; }
        .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; } .logo span { color: #00ffaa; }
        .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 20px; }
        .card { background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 12px; padding: 25px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .input-field { width: 100%; padding: 12px; background: #070b16; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; }
        .btn-action { padding: 12px 20px; background: #00ffaa; color: #070b16; border: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; }
        .ticket-item { border-bottom: 1px solid #334155; padding: 15px 0; }
        .badge { padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; }
        .badge-open { background: rgba(255,170,0,0.2); color: #ffaa00; }
        .badge-closed { background: rgba(0,255,170,0.2); color: #00ffaa; }
        .reply-box { background: #070b16; border-right: 3px solid #00ffaa; padding: 10px; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar">
        <a href="dashboard.html" class="logo">CYBER<span>NEXA</span></a>
        <a href="dashboard.html" style="color: #00ffaa; text-decoration: none;">← العودة</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="container">
        <h1 style="margin-bottom: 30px;">🎫 الدعم الفني</h1>
        
        <div class="card">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">إنشاء تذكرة جديدة</h3>
            <input type="text" id="ticketSubject" class="input-field" placeholder="موضوع المشكلة (مثال: لا أستطيع تسجيل الدخول)">
            <textarea id="ticketMessage" class="input-field" rows="4" placeholder="اشرح المشكلة بالتفصيل..."></textarea>
            <button onclick="createTicket()" class="btn-action">إرسال التذكرة</button>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">تذاكري السابقة</h3>
            <div id="myTicketsList">
                <p style="color: #94a3b8;">جاري التحميل...</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="js/tickets.js"></script>
</body>
</html>